Huntloop — third-party notices
==============================

This file records the licences of things Huntloop ships or builds with, and
names the ones whose provenance still needs confirming. It exists because an
asset is not licensed by virtue of sitting in a repository, and the audit
found several here whose terms nobody had written down.


Fonts
-----

Both are served from Huntloop's own origin. `next/font/google`
downloads them at build time rather than linking to a font CDN, so no
request leaves the user's browser to a third party — see the reasoning in
`apps/web/app/layout.tsx`.

  Geist, Geist Mono
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright (c) 2023 Vercel, in collaboration with basement.studio
    https://github.com/vercel/geist-font

The OFL asks that its copyright and licence notice travel with the font
files. Build-time subsetting makes that awkward to do literally, and common
practice ignores it; this file is the notice instead, which costs nothing and
removes the question.


